Autosaved classification CSVs land here.

Mosaic tool:
  no seed:   classification_mosaic_autosave_{name}_{n_stamps}_{ncols}_99.csv
  with seed: classification_mosaic_autosave_{name}_{n_stamps}_{ncols}_{nrows}_{seed}.csv

1-by-1 viewer:
  no seed:   classification_single_{name}_{n_stamps}.csv
  with seed: classification_single_{name}_{n_stamps}_{seed}.csv

A "-(N)" suffix is appended when a file with the same name already exists
but describes a different dataset.
